Map imagery, pre-computed SIFT features, road networks and game coordinate
transforms are loaded at runtime from a local checkout of
greatredo/wardogs-navigator (https://github.com/greatredo/wardogs-navigator),
which is licensed under Apache-2.0 for its code; see that project's
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the rights to the map assets. Game imagery and
trademarks belong to their respective owners.

wardog_ad/localization.py adapts the minimap matching approach (SIFT feature
mask, ratio test, RANSAC partial affine, local re-tracking and convexity-defect
arrow heading) from wardogs_nav/vision.py of the same project (Apache-2.0).
Upstream copyright: Copyright 2026 Wardogs Navigator contributors.
The Apache-2.0 license and upstream NOTICE are retained in LICENSES/.

wardog_ad/data/team_bases.json contains deployment-board coordinate facts derived
from apollyon-sys/wardogs-calculator/maps/{ozeti,bakurani,zestafona}.json, retrieved
2026-10-18. The Bakurani source uses its s2-20261016 revision. Coordinates are
reference points inside headquarters, not independently verified vehicle spawns.
